---
// A drawing of the midna window for the landing page: the sidebar with two
// projects, an agent terminal, and a needs-you card asking for approval.
// Plain HTML so it stays sharp at any size and needs no screenshot updates.
---

<div class="mock" role="img" aria-label="The midna window: projects and terminals in a sidebar, Claude Code running in a terminal, and a card asking you to approve a command">
  <div class="chrome">
    <span class="dot r"></span><span class="dot y"></span><span class="dot g"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <aside class="side">
      <div class="need-pill"><span class="pip need"></span>1 needs you <kbd>⌘J</kbd></div>
      <p class="proj">web <span class="badge">1</span></p>
      <div class="row active">
        <span class="pip need"></span>
        <div><b>claude · checkout</b><small class="need-text">wants to run a command</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="pip work"></span>
        <div><b>codex · flaky tests</b><small>working · 4m</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="pip ok"></span>
        <div><b>dev server</b><small>monitor · up 2h</small></div>
      </div>
      <p class="proj">api</p>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="pip idle"></span>
        <div><b>shell</b><small>~/src/api</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="today">
        <span class="today-label">Today</span>
        <div class="today-stats">
          <span><b>38</b>turns</span>
          <span><b>12</b>messages</span>
          <span><b>$4.20</b>spent</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="main">
      <div class="head"><span class="pip need"></span><b>claude · checkout</b><span class="glyph">✳</span></div>
      <pre class="term"><span class="dim">›</span> make the checkout form remember the last card

<span class="acc">⏺</span> I'll add a saved-card option. Reading the form first.
  <span class="dim">⎿ Read src/checkout/Form.tsx (212 lines)</span>
<span class="acc">⏺</span> Updated Form.tsx and the payment hook.
<span class="acc">⏺</span> Running the checkout tests before I finish.</pre>
      <div class="card">
        <div>
          <b>Allow <code>npm test -- checkout</code>?</b>
          <span>claude · checkout · web</span>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <span class="approve">Approve <kbd>⌘↩</kbd></span>
          <span class="deny">Deny</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="status">
    <span><span class="pip ok"></span> midnad · 4 terminals</span>
    <span>Policy <b>auto</b> · 3 rules</span>
    <span class="hide-sm">Webhooks on</span>
    <span class="right">⌘K commands</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .mock {
    --m-bg: #0f1117;
    --m-panel: #151821;
    --m-raised: #1d2130;
    --m-line: #282d3b;
    --m-term: #0b0d12;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--m-bg);
    box-shadow:
      0 40px 120px -40px rgba(183, 154, 232, 0.35),
      0 20px 50px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: left;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .chrome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    background: var(--m-panel);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--m-line);
  }

  .dot {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3a3f4d;
  }
  .dot.r { background: #ff5f57; }
  .dot.y { background: #febc2e; }
  .dot.g { background: #28c840; }

  .body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 210px 1fr;
    min-height: 330px;
  }

  .side {
    background: var(--m-panel);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--m-line);
    padding: 12px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .need-pill {
    margin: 0 10px 12px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--need);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(242, 169, 59, 0.1);
    color: var(--need);
    font-weight: 600;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .need-pill kbd,
  .card kbd {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    opacity: 0.85;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .proj {
    margin: 6px 14px 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .badge {
    background: var(--need);
    color: #15111c;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 0 6px;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 9px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  .row.active {
    background: var(--m-raised);
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .row b {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .row small {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }

  .row small.need-text {
    color: var(--need);
  }

  .pip {
    flex: none;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-top: 6px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .pip.need { background: var(--need); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(242, 169, 59, 0.22); }
  .pip.work { background: var(--work); }
  .pip.ok { background: var(--ok); }
  .pip.idle { border: 1.5px solid var(--ink-faint); }

  .need-pill .pip,
  .head .pip,
  .status .pip {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .today {
    margin: auto 10px 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--m-line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--m-raised);
  }

  .today-label {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .today-stats {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .today-stats b {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--m-term);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--m-line);
    background: var(--m-bg);
  }

  .glyph {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .term {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #d7dbe4;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .dim { color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .acc { color: var(--accent); }

  .card {
    margin: 0 12px 12px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--need);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--m-panel);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .card b {
    display: block;
  }

  .card code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .card span {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .actions span {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 6px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .approve {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #15111c !important;
  }

  .deny {
    border: 1px solid var(--m-line);
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .status {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--m-line);
    background: var(--m-panel);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .status span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .status b {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .status .right {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .side {
      display: none;
    }
    .hide-sm {
      display: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
